ing new. Venture off in search of rich resource deposits, uncover unique landscapes, and share your favorite world seeds with friends. But beware, exploration comes at a cost, native hostile creatures roam the planet so you'll need to be prepared!\n\nBuild sprawling factories that stretch across the terrain, connected with miles of conveyor belts. Merge and split belts of items to optimize production lines and keep your factory running at peak efficiency. From simple smelters to complex oil refineries, every machine pushes your automation further as you expand your industrial empire!", "themes": [{"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/belts-of-iron", "videos": [{"id": 165524, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "jg2jKkd0SUE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jg2jKkd0SUE", "title": "Belts of Iron Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jg2jKkd0SUE/sddefault.jpg"}]}